```Detection Heartbeat V1: Sysmon events that carry the run marker, grouped by probe. Replace $marker$; time range = the probe window.```
index=wazuh_archives "EventChannel" "$marker$"
| rex field=_raw "EventChannel (?<_json>\{.*\})$"
| spath input=_json path=win.system.eventID output=eid
| spath input=_json path=win.eventdata.image output=image
| eval img=lower(image)
| eval probe=case(
    eid="1" AND match(img,"rundll32\.exe$"),"P2",
    eid="1" AND match(img,"(whoami|hostname|ipconfig|systeminfo|net1?|tasklist|netstat)\.exe$"),"P1",
    eid="13","P3",
    true(),"other")
| stats count min(_time) as first max(_time) as last values(eid) as eids by probe
